{
  "name": "history-fixed-to-week-based-week-pattern-transition",
  "description": "A change from 1 July fixed-date years to week-based years ending on the last Sunday of December (weeks from Monday), through a 26-week transition from Monday 2024-07-01 to Sunday 2024-12-29 with a week_pattern of 4-4-5-4-4-5 weeks in two quarters. Numbered by 'majority': 2023, 2024 (the transition), 2025. In the transition, weeks nest in periods and Period.weeks is set; in the 1 July years before it a week's parent is the year. Illustrative.",
